alid_paths error_paths\n            (undetected by: malloc_failure)\n  KILLED  m5  by: error_paths malloc_failure\n            (undetected by: valid_paths)\n  KILLED  m6  by: valid_paths error_paths\n            (undetected by: malloc_failure)\n  KILLED  m7  by: valid_paths error_paths\n            (undetected by: malloc_failure)\n\nMUTATION CHECK: OK — real translation passes, all mutants killed.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
